  "date": "2010-11-13 05:04:14",
  "excerpt": "We did a double header meeting in the North and South bay to kick off the Flash On group.  It was a lot of work to coordinate and present back-to-back meetings, but it all came together.  A big thanks to my co-presenter Oswald Campesator, my co-coordinators Keith Sutton and Justin Webb, and also, Nick Turner, from Plug and Play's Mobile Meetup, who did an outstanding job on Thursday evening.",
